#: scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29bea26e190b814e651ebb94d64df0b7170f44f418ba1486037dc9de92acd2d5
#. default-sha256: b48047de1a86b85b6976dcbea8b2962008f05cc99cb51540136ee44c9eb2e352
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I received no visitors except the servants—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫and "
"again, none of them would look me in the eye."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫방에는 아무도 찾아오질 않았으며, ⟪k:7⟫눈을 안 맞추는 수발 담당"
"자만이 왔다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d01115cc5e6808555427599b3f74eda891b7d5956a060cf303feff318fa390e3
#. default-sha256: 0f3d7a5fcbc2660560b52254949511e65cf9196d81df560cfaa2f0ed412298a8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every day was the same. Day in and day out, day in and day out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫매일, ⟪k:1⟫매일, ⟪k:2⟫매일―― 그게 다였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88b6b792482ff5530789c8d7db1353c46a650e2149bd253fe05b4f28814c9077
#. default-sha256: 35f69ae4b4060dd5598d12209355d3359e4217c5fa7495cbeeb2116ce2f5ed84
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was my mother’s handwriting on the parchment.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We lived in the same house, yet "
"she refused to show herself before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫양피지에 적힌 깔끔한 글자는 ⟪k:1⟫어머니 필체였다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫어머니는 같은 집에 살면서도 ⟪k:4⟫"
"결코 나를 찾아오지 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4772dd528c9f5a897ef7306fccd41f449303b8e980dcc2a5a3ff9bed3d22231
#. default-sha256: c3b74d209b71e32b3f3b26c0dc0a8d8c9e0809be599da333c2e49be2c5e6000c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no choice but to respond to her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫어머니의 편지에 답장을 보내야만 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79c04a694838525276389e0e7c34cc316473378437dfa52d69d8190e8d825a50
#. default-sha256: b3d9363b67e67ec2172d1d3fb4c773c7f3843cf148030419d42c670ba91cbde2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a constant sense of urgency to her letters—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like she might fall apart "
"completely at any second."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니의 문자에는 늘 절박한 감정이 담겨――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d885422f5f867d2d2a817e88a54645476c40c12ec1216ed31e8d2d22ca7b9ede
#. default-sha256: 45044fc4ed4c997e51dff9cb18f588f06856cea8c57e8ef0eaec8143bf88518b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On paper, she expressed her concern for me, but that concern only served to cause me more "
"pain,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어머니는 편지상으로 ⟪k:1⟫늘 나를 걱정했지만,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫어머니의 감정은 ⟪k:4⟫번번이 나를 다치"
"게 했고――"

