msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’d had no idea how miserable it was to go so long without water.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My throat was dry "
"and cracked, and it felt like it was on fire,⟪k:3⟫making breathing difficult."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫물이 없다는 게 ⟪k:1⟫이토록 괴롭단 건―― 처음 알았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫얼얼해진 목이 ⟪k:4⟫타들어 가듯 "
"아파 ⟪k:5⟫내 호흡을 앗았다."

